# Project Notes

## Environment

Operating System: Kali Linux  
Platform: Oracle VirtualBox  
Container Platform: Docker  
Orchestration: Docker Compose

## ELK Components

Elasticsearch:
Stores the collected SIEM events.

Logstash:
Processes and forwards security events to Elasticsearch.

Filebeat:
Collects log data and sends it to Logstash.

Kibana:
Provides data exploration and security event visualization.

## Data

The project uses simulated security log events in a controlled laboratory environment.

## Elasticsearch Index

SIEM events are stored using the `siem-events-*` index pattern.

## Kibana

Data View:
SIEM Events

Dashboard:
Mini SIEM Security Dashboard

Time Range:
Last 7 days

